<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 302 0 R
/E (JK Cement is a global leader in white cement with 1.12 MnTPA capacity in India and 1.33 MnTPA wall putty capacity. The division holds 45-48% market share in white cement and 22% in wall putty, with products exported to 36 countries. The company pioneered India's first limestone-based white cement plant in 1984 at Gotan, Rajasthan. In Q2 FY26, the segment achieved 10% YoY growth in combined white cement and wall putty sales. Both JK White Cement and JK Wall Putty were awarded Superbrand status in 2019. The company operates international facilities through JK Cement Works \(Fujairah\) FZC with 0.6 MnTPA white cement capacity. However, the segment faces competitive pressures from aggressive pricing, particularly in the putty segment. In July 2025, the board approved significant investments to expand white cement and wall putty operations in India.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
