/P 304 0 R
/T (The global cement industry is projected to grow at a CAGR of 4-5% between 2025 and 2035, supported by infrastructure-led growth in developing economies, post-pandemic recovery in construction activity, and increased focus on affordable housing. However, growth in developed markets is expected to remain muted due to saturation and stricter environmental regulations.)
/E (The global cement industry is projected to grow at a CAGR of 4-5% between 2025 and 2035, supported by infrastructure-led growth in developing economies, post-pandemic recovery in construction activity, and increased focus on affordable housing. However, growth in developed markets is expected to remain muted due to saturation and stricter environmental regulations.)
/Pg 15 0 R
